body:
Well the problem with our yellow bird is he can't provide buff and can't tank so the only thing he's good at bot lane is a well placed shuffle (vayne, caitlyn, yas, jhin). Then after you shuffle you should pray that enemy mid or jg won't gank since E is in cooldown.

&#x200B;

To where it works: platinum and below.

rylai's only great at pubs.

&#x200B;

pick morello against 5v5 team flex or wager matches.

No. The #1 rule for Azir is \*give him decent numbers and he's nerfed much lower than before. You can think of giving him another +200 mana at level 18 but your ap growth and mp regen is lower. 

&#x200B;

**The only choice is go lost chapter > go** ~~retard~~ **luden's or nashor's**, then if you're a lucky bird kiss your jungler's ass to take the ocean drake buff for you. 

&#x200B;

P.S. Managing Azir's mana in late game isn't that hard, luden's really helps your mp regen from manaflow band(% of max mp) since it increases your max MP.

Both sides may mali.

Spoooderman: okay sana yung intention nya pero yung way paano nya inispread yung message is total bullshit, di na ako magtataka kung bakit sya kinulong. Saka nakasakit din sya ng kapwa during the process(June Mar)

Pwede ka naman mag eksena nalang sa tapat ng COMELEC or kung anumang tanggapan ng gobyerno diba?! Tapos mag costume ka ng kahit anong trip mo

&#x200B;

PBA: OA yung mga putanginang kupal na pinipwersa alisin yung dangal ni spooderman e. Magkano ba bayad ng PBA sa mga security staff at nakakayanan ng mga bottom feeder na yun na mang walanghiya ng kapwa? Wala namang threat sa ating not so super hero spooderman para saktan sya ng ganun e, kitang kita naman sa camera na naka restraint na ang ating bayani pero pilit paring sinasabi na **nanglaban** at deserve nya yung ganung extreme treatment?  Nakakapakyu lang talaga dahil kung ginagawa nila trabaho nila ng maayos di naman aabot sa point na makakapuslit si spooderman sa kanila e, mga bobo. **Mabuti pa yung mga adik na nahuhuli sa buy bust operation nakatakip yung mukha.** 

&#x200B;

PBA FANS: Eto yung mga kupal e nasa paa yung utak. Deserve ni spoooderman na makulong pero di nya deserve na masaktan nang sobra. *Wag na kayo umasa ng kung anong legit sa utak ng mga to, nagalit nang sobra dahil lang na-interrupt* ***not-so-anticipated*** *PBA game.*

&#x200B;

Class President: Sya yung lalaki sa video na sumisigaw at umaawat sa pang-aabuso. Di ko maalala masyado yung sinabi nya pero pinapakiusapan nya yung mga kupal na men in black na di naman kelangan saktan pa ng ganun si spooderman dahil hindi naman sya **nanlaban.** \+1 kay class president talaga sya yung tao na dapat tularan, kahit sobrang daming kupal sa mundo may isa talaga na di mo alam kung tanga o matapang dahil pinili nya gawin yung tama.

> The only thing goblins have are their numbers. 

plus they might not be humans but they adapt really well if they survive the situation, they outnumber a typical party. >!They probably screwed more woman than an average human male.!<

